Package: linux-image-4.19.191-oppo-joan
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Linux kernel for Oppo A38 (CPH2579)
 This package contains the Linux kernel for the Oppo A38 (CPH2579) device.
 .
 Note: This package only ships the kernel image and modules, you should probably
 look at the linux-bootimage-4.19.191-oppo-joan package for a bootimage suitable
 for Android boot loaders.

Package: linux-bootimage-4.19.191-oppo-joan
