Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         linux-image-4.19.191-oppo-joan (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Linux kernel for Oppo A38 (CPH2579) - Android Boot Image
 This package contains the Linux kernel for the Oppo A38 (CPH2579) device.
 .
 Note: This package ships an Android Boot Image bundled with Halium's
 initramfs.

